  "job_B9.5.6_20251003_115036": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6s drihtenlican lichaman & blodes, & \u00fea sona \u00dea so\u00f0lice singendum eallum \u00feam bro\u00f0rum onloten to his gebede se halga man ag\u00e6f his sawle. & ealle \u00fea bro\u00f0ra, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6t w\u00e6ron, gesawon ane culfran gan ut of his mu\u00fee. & \u00fea tohlad se hrof \u00fe\u00e6s gebedhuses, & heo fleah \u00fe\u00e6r ut. & \u00fea bro\u00f0ra hire locodon on, o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t heo sceat in \u00feone heofon. For\u00feon hit is to gelyfanne, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fey w\u00e6re his sawle \u00e6tywed in \u00fe\u00e6re culfran onlicnesse, \u00fe\u00e6t se Eac ic ne forswigie, Petrus, \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t se arwyr\u00fea wer Stephanus se abbod, se for\u00f0ferde in \u00feissere Witodlice se m\u00e6ssepreost of \u00fe\u00e6re tide, \u00fee he \u00feone had underfeng, w\u00e6s lufigende his Ne let he n\u00e6fre hi him neh gan, ne he n\u00e6fre ne ge\u00feafode for \u00e6nigum \u00feingum, \u00fe\u00e6t heo moste him Witodlice halige weras manige habba\u00f0 heom \u00fe\u00e6t to agnum \u00feeawe, \u00feeah \u00fee hi ealne weg syn for For\u00feon se ylca wer wi\u00f0soc, \u00fe\u00e6t him moste beon \u00e6nigu nyd\u00feearfnes ge\u00feegnod \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t wif, \u00fey Witodlice \u00fees arwyr\u00f0a m\u00e6ssepreost \u00fea \u00fea he gefylde \u00fea langan ylde his lifes, \u00fey feowerteog\u00f0an Ac \u00fea \u00fea hine geseah seo his w\u00e6scestre, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s a\u00feened tolysdum \u00feam limum swylce he \u00dea gefelde \u00fe\u00e6t sona se m\u00e6ssepreost,",
